[Hud_Subtitles_Amarr]
Amarr1=The Amarr Empire is the largest and oldest of the four empires.
Amarr2=Ruled by a mighty empress, Amarr is a theocratic society capable of selfless acts and unspeakable evil, all in the name of their god.

[Hud_Subtitles_Caldari]
Caldari1=The Caldari State is a union of powerful mega-corporations, governed by a strict meritocracy.
Caldari2=The state is a fiercely competitive and ruthless society, whos hyper-capitalistic ways have brought its people both misery and triumph.

[Hud_Subtitles_Gallente]
Gallente1=The only true democracy of New Eden, the Gallente Federation is a powerful and prosperous multicultural dominion, that welcomes outsiders with open arms.
Gallente2=Intolerant of closed societies, the Gallente are fierce defenders of personal and social liberties.

[Hud_Subtitles_Intro]
st_00001=Look at this place.
st_00002=Over here.
st_00003=This one seems to be intact.
st_00004=Okay, let’s bring it in for analysis.
st_00005=The implant recovered by the extraction team has fascinating properties.
st_00006=An instant transfer of consciousness - even at the moment of death.
st_00007=So much blood has been spilled in the name of our faith.
st_00008=Too many have died at the hands of empyreans.
st_00009=Imagine the military application.
st_00010=But we have been blessed.
st_00011=I will unleash this new power and end the war.
st_00012=We cannot allow one nation to control it.
st_00013=They have done enough to leave their mark on history.
st_00014=Their soldiers will be dangerous beyond measure.
st_00015=The power they will have …
st_00016=they will be …
st_00017=immortal!

